{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1187319-stupid-question-scion-demigod-and-instant-hypnosis","id":1187319,"title":"STUPID question - Scion: Demigod and Instant Hypnosis","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-18T11:11:55-08:00","id":1187319,"title":"STUPID question - Scion: Demigod and Instant Hypnosis","content":"Howdy,<br /> <br /> Probably obvious question - Knacks in Scion: Demigod are for Legend 5+ characters?<br /> <br /> The rules for Instant Hypnosis supersede the ability of Scions and Supernatural characters to spend 1 Willpower and ignore effects of Mind and Emotion Control?<br /> <br /> Thanks!<br /> <br /> Ken<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3370-ken-winland","name":"Ken Winland","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-18T15:32:29-08:00","id":1187364,"title":"","content":"to have Hypnos you must be 6+ legend<br /> <br /> about the rest, i don't remember very well","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-18T15:59:57-08:00","id":1187372,"title":"","content":"In 1e? I vaguely recall Demigod saying that you don't actually NEED to be a Demigod to take those Knacks. If you qualify, you qualify.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-18T16:19:56-08:00","id":1187376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ken Winland</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1187319-stupid-question-scion-demigod-and-instant-hypnosis#post1187319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Howdy,<br /> <br /> Probably obvious question - Knacks in Scion: Demigod are for Legend 5+ characters?<br /> <br /> The rules for Instant Hypnosis supersede the ability of Scions and Supernatural characters to spend 1 Willpower and ignore effects of Mind and Emotion Control?<br /> <br /> Thanks!<br /> <br /> Ken</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't remember the RAW social rules off the top of my head regarding the Willpower question, but you can take any Knack from any of the Books as long as you meet the requirements. Only one Knack (Hear Prayers) has a requirement for you to be a certain Legend. <br /> <br /> So, you are absolutely allowed to take the Knacks you find in Companion, Ragnarok, Demigod, or God at Legends 1 - 4 as long as you meet the requirements for them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Scion 2e Homebrew Projects:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUnAIZEDk4Zs_W0ELfffeFRAiSel3nAl/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The \u0160iune\u0161</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MMw0vBmHdvuGUbVhyFw7BpXT49UgECnR/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Enduri</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CZuVp5VuftwuwHtzrWADqIaq7Vl-LMIr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Sg\u0101\u2019na Qeda\u2019s</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17piJ8ZBzvt4PL47vz5Gw3BF6HOZelrfh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Abosom</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rk9BKLqbUEroFDvuPSQOwp-pBRxSvN9P/view\" target=\"_blank\">The Zemi</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/324026/Nemetondevos-Revised\" target=\"_blank\">Nemetondevos: Revised</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325461/Mysteries-of-the-Otherworld\" target=\"_blank\">Mysteries of the Otherworld</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/394-watcher","name":"Watcher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"662"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}